                                "text": "1988, Charlotte MacLeod (as Alisa Craig), The Grub-and-Stakers Pinch a Poke, New York: Avon, Chapter 6, p. 48,\n[…] Minerva […] arrived with a huge armload of costumes, followed by Zilla and a couple more, all afoam with petticoats."
